# Files excluded from the deployed static-assets bucket (the ASSETS
# binding in wrangler.jsonc). The Worker source itself is bundled and
# deployed separately by `wrangler deploy` — it doesn't need to also be
# served as a downloadable static file, and the docs/config below are
# for developers, not site visitors.
